<title>USA: Bed Bath &amp; Beyond Nov same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>Bed Bath &amp; Beyond Nov same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD, N.J. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percentage change</p>
<p>	    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	 $91.6	$70.9	 +29.2     +2.4</p>
<p>Year-to-date$578.0     $425.4	+35.9     +6.3</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>This November period did not include the Thanksgiving holiday while last November did.</p>
<p>Month is  five  weeks ended November 24  .</p>
<p>Full company name is Bed Bath &amp; Beyond Inc</p>
